                            {
                                "example_id": "bdb8b647-d93d-44ff-baa4-a8d9bbe9b0f2",
                                "sense_id": "5c8827db-82b5-37e3-856a-ef1cbd35e305",
                                "text": "Because of the senator's parentage, he did not have to follow the lengthy naturalization process that aliens without American parents must undergo. Instead, Cruz was naturalized at birth. This provision has not always been available. For example, there were several decades in the 19th century when children of Americans born abroad were not given automatic naturalization."
